+  "initial_plan": {
+    "can_answer_question": "partly: the data cannot measure motorist fatality risk per mile because it contains no miles-driven or vehicle-miles-traveled exposure; it can show annual counts of reported motorist deaths as an outcome-only proxy",
+    "metric": "annual number of motorist deaths (sum of number_of_motorist_killed)",
